'''Alex Dexter Johnson''' (born August 18, 1968) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[wide receiver]] for the [[Houston Oilers]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Miami Hurricanes football|Miami Hurricanes]].<ref>{{Cite web |url=https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/J/JohnAl24.htm | title=Alex Johnson Stats |access-date=October 25, 2023 |publisher=Pro-Football-Reference.com}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |title=Alex Johnson, WR |url=https://www.nfl.com/players/alex-johnson/ |access-date=October 25, 2023 |work=Nfl.com}}</ref><ref>{{Cite news|url=https://newspapers.com/article/south-florida-sun-sentinel/134589195/|newspaper=[[Sun Sentinel]]|via=[[Newspapers.com]]|date=September 17, 1987|page=39|title=Backs To The Future|author=Mell, Randall}} {{Open access}}</ref>

